  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Community Recovery Fund 2023-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at contributing to community recovery interventions and nexus approaches in key sectors, addressing displacement and strengthening individual and community resilience. 
The Community Recovery Fund is set up as a multi-partner trust fund (MPTF) so that partners can pool investments, optimize financial commitments, minimize risks, and cut transaction costs for critical early recovery outputs. The Fund also builds on the following advantages: Government ownership and leadership; UN operational presence, technical expertise and partnerships; and a transparent and coordinated overview of recovery and reconstruction efforts.</narrative>
  </description>
